      "body": "**npm** is a popular platform that Parmak İzi does not support yet, because no reliable rule has been found so far.\n\n### What was tried\n\n- URL: `https://www.npmjs.com/~{u}` and `https://registry.npmjs.org/-/user/org.couchdb.user:{u}`\n- Result: The website returns a Cloudflare challenge (403); the registry endpoint answers 401 for every name.\n\nA rule is only accepted when `parmakizi --self-test` finds a **known account** and does **not** find a **random name**.\n\n### Idea\n\nThe registry search API (`/-/v1/search?text=maintainer:{u}`) might distinguish users without authentication.\n\n### How to contribute\n\n1. Add one line to [`parmakizi/sites.json`](https://github.com/cybergah/parmakizi/blob/main/parmakizi/sites.json) (see [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/cybergah/parmakizi/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) for the fields).\n2. Run `parmakizi --self-test -s \"npm\"` a few times; it must print `OK` every time.\n3. Open a pull request and paste the self-test output.\n\nPublic pages and public APIs only: no logins, cookies or API keys.\n",
